{
  "abstract": "For a sequence of points on the circle, let M_n and m_n be the longest and shortest arcs between consecutive points among the first n points. De Bruijn and Erdős proved that the best possible values of limsup n·M_n, liminf n·m_n and limsup M_n/m_n are 1/log 2, 1/log 4 and 2. This formalizes all three equalities as stated in formal-conjectures (Erdős Problem 1221, variant r_one).",
